WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.117 --> 00:00:04.945
A moon appeared on a screen.

2
00:00:04.946 --> 00:00:08.765
"That's Sandy Moon," Captain Nova said.

3
00:00:08.766 --> 00:00:14.107
"Space Patrol has a small base there," Bot said.

4
00:00:14.108 --> 00:00:18.811
"A worker's rover broke down," Captain Nova said.

5
00:00:18.812 --> 00:00:26.939
"He tried to walk back to base.

6
00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:33.454
But he stepped in moon sand."

7
00:00:33.455 --> 00:00:37.664
Ringo gasped. "He'll sink!"

8
00:00:37.665 --> 00:00:40.781
Captain Nova nodded.

9
00:00:40.782 --> 00:00:43.407
"The base doesn't have another rover.

10
00:00:43.408 --> 00:00:47.840
The other worker can't reach him."

11
00:00:47.841 --> 00:00:50.699
"Don't worry, Captain," Ringo said.

12
00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:54.782
"We'll bring a new rover to Sandy Moon."

13
00:00:54.783 --> 00:00:57.041
More kids ran by.

14
00:00:57.042 --> 00:01:05.451
They screamed and laughed.

15
00:01:05.452 --> 00:01:10.297
"I'm happy to leave the base, Captain," Ringo said.

16
00:01:10.298 --> 00:01:14.021
"No little kids!"

17
00:01:14.022 --> 00:01:17.648
The small boy ran into the office.

18
00:01:17.649 --> 00:01:21.454
"Zoom! I'm on a mission!"

19
00:01:21.455 --> 00:01:29.180
Ringo gasped. "He's got my model spaceship!"

20
00:01:29.181 --> 00:01:33.742
The boy ran back out.

21
00:01:33.743 --> 00:01:36.216
Ringo ran into the hallway.

22
00:01:36.217 --> 00:01:38.427
He saw Commander Cosmo.

23
00:01:38.428 --> 00:01:42.593
"Spark! Stop running!" the commander shouted.

24
00:01:42.594 --> 00:01:46.522
Spark stomped over to the commander.

25
00:01:46.523 --> 00:01:49.437
"This base is boring, Dad.

26
00:01:49.438 --> 00:01:52.590
I want to fly in a spaceship!"

27
00:01:52.591 --> 00:01:57.501
Commander Cosmo sighed.

28
00:01:57.502 --> 00:02:00.878
"Is anybody going on a mission?"

29
00:02:00.879 --> 00:02:06.413
"Um, I am," Ringo said. "But . . . "

30
00:02:06.414 --> 00:02:09.872
Commander Cosmo smiled. "Perfect!

31
00:02:09.873 --> 00:02:16.993
Spark will go with you!"

